<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 293)</h2>
<p><b>Compare from the web, and a resync button for peace of mind.</b></p>
<ul>
<li>Web reviewers can start a compare: an A|B chip in the clip list compares the current clip against any other — the app loads the B side automatically and everyone sees the wipe. Clicking the compare badge ends it for the room.</li>
<li>Resync Web Peers, in the Share to Web sheet: rebroadcasts the whole session state to every connected seat. Always safe — peers keep exactly one copy of everything.</li>
<li>Web polish: the mute button shows a slashed speaker when muted, the brush sliders are labeled SIZE and FILL, and notice banners moved to the bottom edge — the old top banner covered the header controls.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
